     Device-wide IWLAN keepalive tuning for ath11k (no firmware NAT-T offload):
     relax NAT-T keepalive (20s -> 60s) and IKEv2 DPD (120s -> 300s) to cut
     VoWiFi deep-doze AP wakeups by ~3x while staying inside NAT UDP timeouts.
-->
<carrier_config_list>
    <carrier_config>
        <int name="iwlan.natt_keep_alive_timer_sec_int" value="60" />
        <int name="iwlan.dpd_timer_sec_int" value="300" />
    </carrier_config>
</carrier_config_list>
